      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠣᠷᠨᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>torniqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>торних</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TORNI-</transcript>
      <definition>[= tarni-] v.i. To grow, grow up (of children and young animals); to stand on one's feet; to improve (of health).</definition>
      <page>827</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠡᠦᠺᠡᠳ ᠲᠣᠷᠨᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>keyked --xu</transcript>
          <definition> For the children to grow.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠳᠦ ᠲᠣᠷᠨᠢᠬᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>nidy --xu</transcript>
          <definition> To open the eyes wide; to stare.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
